---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p>
      Hello world! I like:
      <ul>
        <li>Beautiful math problems and proofs</li>
        <li>
          Discovering that a difficult theorem is actually trivial
        </li>
        <li>Tuning my piano and playing it</li>
        <li>Everything written by Chopin</li>
        <li>C++</li>
        <li>
          Making software, especially interactive tools that help me explore
          mathematical ideas or do things existing software doesn't do
          satisfactorily.
        </li>
        <li>Software that starts instantly</li>
        <li>
          Being able to understand everyone in a conversation
        </li>
      </ul>
      I dislike:
      <ul>
        <li>Mosquitoes</li>
        <li>Unnecessarily complicated explanations</li>
        <li>C</li>
        <li>Software that takes 20 seconds to start</li>
        <li>
          Being surrounded by conversation I cannot understand
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <h2>More about me</h2>
    <p>
      I was born deaf, but can hear some sounds. With hearing aids, one-on-one
      conversations are okay, group conversations are impossible. Phone calls
      are impossible. I strongly prefer Discord and internet forums to group
      conversations in real life. I do find social media too performative for my
      tastes, but I participate in it every once in a while.
    </p>

    <p>
      I have a PhD in mathematics, though I like understanding
      mathematical structures more than producing theorems.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
